115.0454, 113.3754, 114.0056, 116.0577, 113.5113, 113.639, 113.4499, 113.5478, 114.4011, 112.2633, 111.9473, 112.001, 110.7173, 108.3249, 110.8898, 111.0844, 109.9548, 111.4094, 112.2994, 110.011, 111.324, 110.4077, 111.088, 111.7568, 112.001, 113.6507, 115.1033, 112.9806, 115.5411, 117.0667, 115.8229, 112.2764, 112.1627, 114.6351, 114.1805, 114.2215, 115.1459, 115.5448, 115.7773, 114.6376, 115.6477, 115.87, 113.7117, 112.8302, 113.1958, 119.3149, 123.0848, 121.8837, 123.563, 127.296, 127.9892, 123.0092, 124.3628, 125.0677, 125.0079, 127.4183, 127.5082, 132.0753, 132.9526, 135.8224, 134.3462, 136.2639, 134.4793, 136.5911, 136.9173, 134.846, 133.5082, 130.6874, 135.7591, 135.9431, 137.412, 132.3536, 135.9179, 132.5843, 133.2087, 132.1234, 132.5508, 132.165, 129.066, 128.7688, 128.7019, 128.7432, 129.8471, 130.3077, 131.0049, 133.1158, 132.5809, 130.04, 129.1048, 126.5281, 127.1381, 126.7361, 128.3544, 128.303, 127.0562, 131.6803, 131.6297, 131.5267, 131.3117, 133.0687, 131.1501, 128.2438, 130.2024, 128.8034, 129.4128, 128.8794, 130.3469, 129.3747, 131.4988, 130.6957, 131.3236, 132.2464, 130.7772, 132.254, 133.1907, 131.2269, 127.5738, 125.2375, 124.5186, 124.6802, 123.2383, 125.0678, 126.0905, 124.7713, 125.305, 126.9907, 126.9197, 125.4198, 125.389, 126.3053, 125.0706, 124.529, 125.4094, 124.4468, 124.9152, 123.8544, 123.013, 123.1124, 121.404, 121.1862, 118.9466, 118.4656, 118.6693, 118.7873, 117.548, 119.164, 119.1795, 117.7824, 117.9639, 117.1436, 116.9932, 116.7686, 117.8585, 119.116, 119.3537, 118.6222, 118.6198, 118.3607, 118.9051, 119.7427, 118.4458, 118.1337, 119.2225, 119.2977, 118.3176, 118.2625, 118.4798, 117.5726, 117.7269, 117.4336, 116.9707, 115.826, 115.8906, 115.9799, 115.8449, 116.7752, 118.1802, 118.1243, 118.2845, 118.4573, 119.1989, 119.5772, 119.8181], "summary_html": "<h1>Turnover-Illiquidity Factor</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>This paper (China A-shares) decomposes turnover into liquidity, firm-specific uncertainty, and investor attention following Barinov (2014). The key finding: turnover is positively related to bid-ask spread (illiquidity) and return volatility (uncertainty), and these illiquidity/uncertainty components drive price delay and predict positive future returns.</p>\n<p>The CTA migration maps two of these channels onto the commodity-futures cross-section (production variant <code>clean_vw120_noex_h15_raw</code>, exactly matching <code>meta.json</code>):</p>\n<p>1. <strong>Turnover proxy</strong>: <code>turnover_raw = volume / max(opi, 1)</code> (volume divided by open interest, the commodity analogue of equity turnover). 2. <strong>Turnover change (uncertainty momentum)</strong>: <code>turn60 = MA60(turnover_raw)</code>, then <code>turn_chg60 = turn60 / shift60(turn60) - 1</code> — the 60-day momentum of smoothed turnover. 3. <strong>Amihud illiquidity</strong>: <code>amihud_raw = |change| / max(amount, 1)</code>, then <code>amihud60 = MA60(amihud_raw)</code> — the 60-day mean of the daily Amihud ratio.</p>\n<p>All symbols participate (no symbol exclusion). Rows with non-finite <code>turn_chg60</code> or <code>amihud60</code> are dropped. Each of the two features is cross-sectionally ranked and converted to a continuous score in [-1, 1] via <code>rank_to_continuous(scale=2.0)</code>, then <strong>equal-weight combined (0.5 / 0.5)</strong>. The combined direction is vol-target scaled (target 15% annualized, vol_window=120, max_leverage=2.0) and held for 15 trading days between rebalances. High-ranked commodities (high turnover-change + high illiquidity) go long; low-ranked go short.</p>\n<p><strong>Key findings:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Direction is unchanged from the paper (rising uncertainty + high illiquidity → long).</li>\n<li><strong>2026-09-17 替换</strong>：旧版 <code>clean_vw120_h15_raw</code> 剔除 8 个\"持续偏弱\"品种（FU、MA、C、P、PP、I、M、JD），名单来自 R3/R4 的样本内亏损诊断，属于项目禁止的事后全局黑名单（样本外平均排名 28.2/57，FU、MA 样本外排第 54、48）。去掉名单后样本内 1.31→1.01，仍过硬过滤，与旧版相关 0.96；未加滚动门控（加门控版本的样本外更好，但按样本外选版本属于偷看）。样本外（2025/06 起）Sharpe -0.42，列入观察。</li>\n<li>The production variant uses a <strong>120-day</strong> vol window (<code>vw120</code>) rather than the default 60.</li>\n<li>Non-redundant against the existing library (max correlation low).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Lookahead control:</strong> All features use trailing rolling windows (<code>MA60</code>, <code>shift(60)</code>) and trailing-window CS ranks available at T's close; execution is T+1 open. No future data is used.</p>\n<blockquote>Note: the Polars reference calls <code>sym_rolling_ic_gate</code> on each feature, but the gate output is never consumed downstream — ranking uses the raw feature columns. The production Pandas code omits the gate entirely (output is bit-identical, corr 1.0000). There is <strong>no active IC gate</strong> in the production variant.</blockquote>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>0.54</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>2.2%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>4.1%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-8.3%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.03</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>3434</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025/05)</td><td><strong>1.01</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025/06+)</td><td><strong>-0.42</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>0.91 / 1.10</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2012</th><th>2013</th><th>2014</th><th>2015</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.4</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.8</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.08</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.47</span></td><td>0.76</td><td>1.26</td><td>1.03</td><td>0.89</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.1</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.44</span></td><td>1.35</td><td>1.28</td><td>1.94</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.01</span></td><td>0.43</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>volume</code></td><td>成交量</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>opi</code></td><td>持仓量</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>amount</code></td><td>成交额</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每 15 个交易日</li>\n<li><strong>信号更新</strong>: 每日计算，每 15 天生效</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>51</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>3351</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>95.5%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>32.9</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p><strong>Turnover proxy:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{turnover\\_raw}_t = \\frac{\\text{volume}_t}{\\max(\\text{opi}_t, 1)}</div>\n<p><strong>Turnover change (uncertainty momentum):</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{turn60}_t = \\text{MA}_{60}(\\text{turnover\\_raw})_t, \\qquad \\text{turn\\_chg60}_t = \\frac{\\text{turn60}_t}{\\text{turn60}_{t-60}} - 1</div>\n<p><strong>Amihud illiquidity (60-day mean):</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{amihud60}_t = \\text{MA}_{60}\\!\\left(\\frac{|\\text{change}_t|}{\\max(\\text{amount}_t, 1)}\\right)</div>\n<p><strong>Composite direction:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{direction}_t = 0.5 \\cdot \\text{rank}_c(\\text{turn\\_chg60}_t) + 0.5 \\cdot \\text{rank}_c(\\text{amihud60}_t)</div>\n<p>where <span class=\"math-tex\">\\text{rank}_c(\\cdot)</span> is the cross-sectional rank rescaled to <span class=\"math-tex\">[-1, 1]</span> via <code>rank_to_continuous(scale=2.0)</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Position sizing:</strong> vol-target scaling to 15% annualized using a 120-day rolling vol window (max leverage 2.0), then a 15-day rebalance hold. All symbols participate (no symbol exclusion).</p>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<p><strong>R1 (Sharpe 0.41):</strong> Initial implementation with price delay D1 (Hou-Moskowitz regression), raw turnover, and volatility as separate factors. Turnover 60d MA was the best single factor at 0.41 but daily turnover was extremely high (0.39) consuming 35% of PnL in fees. Price delay D1 performed worst due to slow computation and weak signal. Direction: long high-turnover (uncertainty proxy), short low-turnover.</p>\n<p><strong>R2 (Sharpe 0.66):</strong> Diagnosed that excessive trading costs were the primary drag. Actions: (1) dropped slow/weak price delay D1, (2) increased hold_days from 5 to 20-40, (3) added IC gate (min_ic=0) to filter weak symbols, (4) added Amihud illiquidity ratio based on the paper's core insight that turnover proxies illiquidity. The turnover+Amihud combo at hold=20 became the best variant (0.66). Turnover dropped from 0.39 to 0.15. Key improvement: IC gate removed the worst-performing symbols (V, M, AL) that were dragging returns.</p>\n<p><strong>R3 (Sharpe 0.89):</strong> Built on R2's success with three targeted improvements: (1) tightened IC gate from min_ic=0 to 0.005, filtering more aggressively to keep only symbols with meaningful predictive power (IC&gt;0 from 54% to 74%), (2) added turnover z-score factor (short-term MA vs long-term norm, capturing anomalous uncertainty spikes), (3) combined turnover change rate with Amihud illiquidity -- this combo (<code>chg_amihud_h15</code>) was the breakthrough, reaching 0.89. The turnover change captures the *momentum of uncertainty* while Amihud captures the *level of illiquidity*, complementary signals that align with the paper's decomposition framework.</p>\n<p><strong>Key turning point:</strong> The R3 combination of turnover change + Amihud with strict IC gating was decisive. Turnover change alone had Sharpe 0.69, Amihud alone 0.55, but combined they reached 0.89 -- the factors are genuinely complementary, consistent with the paper's argument that turnover reflects both uncertainty dynamics and liquidity structure.</p>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Frequency</strong>: Daily</li>\n<li><strong>Universe</strong>: All commodity futures (57 symbols active after IC gate filtering)</li>\n<li><strong>Hold Period</strong>: 15 days</li>\n<li><strong>Data Requirements</strong>: volume, opi, change, amount (all standard OHLCV fields)</li>\n<li><strong>Known Limitations</strong>:</li>\n</ul>  - Cross-sectional IC is weak (0.006); the signal is primarily time-series driven\n<p>- First half of sample (2016-2019) has weaker performance (Sharpe 0.68) vs second half (1.21) - Turnover-based signals may degrade during regime changes in market microstructure - Redundancy check: new_signal (max correlation 0.19 with existing factor library)</p>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>TURN_MA_WINDOW</code></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>turn60 rolling mean</td></tr><tr><td><code>TURN_CHG_LAG</code></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>turn_chg60 = turn60 / shift(60) - 1</td></tr><tr><td><code>AMIHUD_WINDOW</code></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>amihud60 rolling mean</td></tr><tr><td><code>VOL_WINDOW</code></td><td><code>120</code></td><td>widened window (vw120)</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 3.84s</li>\n</ul>"}